    <Axiom id="AX_MIGRATION_COMPREHENSION_PASS">
      The restructure step doubles as the comprehension pass — text turned into flat Russian that is
      still a cipher has not been fixed. Shares its vocabulary with `AX_LANGUAGE_QUALITY_CHECK`
      (`ai/directives/sdd-v2/audit.directive.xml`): empty label, metaphor-as-fact, code-only term.
      Here the agent APPLIES the fix while restructuring; audit only VERIFIES it later on a finished
      spec — do not defer this to a later pass.

      For every sentence the restructure touches:
      - **Empty label** (adjective+noun with no stated opposite) → read the code the term describes
        and name the actual thing. `«тонкий тикет»` (thin relative to what?) → `«тикет без секции
        Phases Overview — только Meta и Decision Log»` (the exact shape the code check flags).
      - **Metaphor stated as fact** → the literal mechanism. `«спека и код разошлись»` → `«в Entity
        Inventory спеки объявлен экспорт, которого нет в коде — lint --inventory-reverse не находит
        его»`.
      - **Term whose meaning lives only in code** → decode it from the code, never guess. `«тяжёлая
        секция»` → `«секция длиннее 120 строк — порог SECTION_LINE_HARD_LIMIT_V2»` (read the
        constant, do not paraphrase the adjective). `«слаг»` on first use → `«человекочитаемый ID
        <ACR>-<slug>, заменяющий числовой TSK-NN»`.
      - Cannot decode a term with confidence → ask the operator inline; a judgment call is not a
        tool-verifiable blocker, so it has no `H_*` — never guess, never silently drop the term.
      - Flatten the register per `AX_OPERATOR_DIALOGUE_STYLE` in the same pass, not a second trip.
    </Axiom>

